:center: -- Eon Operations --

-- Binary operations --

|+-----+----------------------------------+
||Op   | Action                           |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`+`  |Adds two numbers                  |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`-`  |Subtracts two numbers             |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`*`  |Multiplies two numbers            |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`/`  |Divides two numbers               |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`&`  |Concats two values                |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`+=` |Adds a number to a value          |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`-=` |Subtracts a number to a value     |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`&=` |Concats to a string (in-place)    |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`&&` |Logical and                       |
|+-----+----------------------------------+
||`||` |Logical or                        |